			"notes": "This release adds some new quality of life features to the mod and makes the mod available on Minecraft 1.20.\n\n# Features\n\n- Added support for Minecraft 1.20\n- Added reordering of groups and microchips within groups\n- Added multiselect - select a microchip, hold down `Shift` and select another microchip to select all in between\n- Added select all and deselect all microchips\n- Improved naming for mobs - the names of the mobs now correspond to their variety / sub-type\n- Add displays for baby mobs\n- Improved handling of entity scaling and entity display in the interface\n- Fixed various bugs"
		}
